  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UK Ghana Chamber of Commerce to provide Technical Advisory Support to Ghana Revenue Authority and Tax Policy Unit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is to provide programme management and delivery services as well provide a programme management team, to work closely with the Ghana Revenue Authority, Ministry of Finance and Civil Society Organisations, to support the delivery of the Ghana Revenue Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
